{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">[02:10]</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">天文台：<span style='color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, \"sans-serif\", \"microsoft jhenghei\";'>珠江口一帶持續有雷雨區發展，預料未來數小時本港雨勢有時頗大。市民請留意天氣變化。</span></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-15T19:18:09.639673+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":53,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}